Type: Package
Package: rdkitpyr
Title: Access Chemoinformatics Functionality in R via the RDKit Python API
Version: 0.0.0.9001
Authors@R: person("Andrey", "Samokhin", , "andrey.s.samokhin@gmail.com",
                  role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
                  comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-0223-6087"))
Description: A task-oriented R interface to the RDKit Python library via
    'reticulate'. The package provides high-level chemoinformatics
    functionality, including molecule parsing, transformation, and descriptor
    calculation, without mirroring RDKit's native API structure.
